8cdf23cf8b7","source":"BTS 11 · #33","image":"/img/scene-clips/7354.webp","imageBytes":21410,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7354.mp4","videoBytes":158545,"duration":4.041667}},"examples":["What does this store sell?","They have many clothes.","It sells shoes and bags.","Do you want to go to the clothing store?","How much is this shirt?","It is fifteen dollars.","Can I try this on?","Sure, the fitting room is over there.","This is too big. Do you have a smaller size?","I like to visit the bookstore.","I would like to buy this, please.","Do you have it in a different color?","Where is the bookstore?","It is next to the bakery.","Let's go to the toy store!","What items are on sale today?","They are on sale for twenty dollars.","Do you have any change?","Here is your receipt. Thank you!","Have a nice day!","What stores do you like to visit?","Do you like shopping for clothes?","Yes, I love shopping for new outfits.","I buy them at the mall.","What's your favorite store?","Do you have a budget when shopping?","Yes, I have limited money.","Do you like to bargain?","Yes, I ask for discounts.","Do you use coupons?","Yes, I always look for coupons.","How much do you usually spend?","I spend about fifty dollars.","Do you have a wallet?","Yes, I have a leather wallet.","What brands do you carry?","Do you carry credit cards?","We accept cash, card, and checks.","Where is the checkout?","Do you need a bag?","Yes, please give me a bag.","No, I need a larger size.","Can I exchange this?","Yes, we allow exchanges.","What is the return policy?","You have thirty days to return.","Do you have a customer loyalty card?","Yes, I have a membership card.","Do you get points for purchases?","Yes, I earn points every time.","You can redeem them for discounts.","Is this item in stock?","Let me check our inventory.","Can you order it for me?","Yes, we can special order it.","How long will it take to arrive?","It will arrive in about a week.","Do you deliver?","Yes, we offer free delivery.","What is the delivery fee?","Delivery is free on orders over fifty.","Can I shop online?","Is it safe to use your website?","Yes, our website is very secure.","Do you accept all payment methods?","What's the best time to shop?","Weekday mornings are less crowded.","Do you have a clearance section?","Yes, we have a clearance area.","Are there discounts for students?","Yes, students get ten percent off.","Can I negotiate the price?","Yes, we match competitor prices.","Sorry, our prices are fixed.","We carry many popular brands.","Do you have your own brand?","Is the store brand good quality?","Yes, it's excellent quality.","Can I speak to the manager?","Of course, one moment please.","I have a question about this product.","I'd be happy to help you.","Is this the newest model?","Yes, it just came in.","When was it released?","It was released last month."]}
